  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is designed to support the protection of girls, women and young mothers on the streets in Cairo, Egypt. A suite of supports will be provided to meet the needs of vulnerable and marginalized girls, mothers and their children on the street including health, welfare and legal services and in day care centres and emergency shelters. The project is also designed to promote homogenous professional practices among local partners and in government run centres including on sensitive issues such as family planning or gender-based violence through the delivery of trainings.</narrative>
  </description>
